  "application_type_full": "Approval of details reserved by a condition (discharge)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Prior to occupation of the development hereby permitted, a Statement of Conformity shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. \rThe Statement of Conformity will be signed by a suitably qualified ecologist named within the Biodiversity Enhancement and Management Plan (BEMP) and include evidence in the form of full details on:\ra.\tstarting and completion dates for each habitat creation / enhancement\rb.\tgeneral weather conditions for each habitat creation / enhancement\rc.\tany limitations / impeding factors during each habitat creation / enhancement phase,\rd.\ttime stamped photographs of each habitat undergoing creation or enhancement\re.\tpost completion photographs of each habitat  / enhancement\rf.\tPost installation photographs of each nesting / roosting feature under Conditions 12\r\rThis condition is to certify that the details for each habitat / feature, as approved under the BEMP, are in accord with the submitted information.\r\rReason: To enhance the biodiversity value of the land in accordance with Policy 26 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.\r",
    "Prior to occupation a Secured By Design final certificate shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.\r\rReason: In order to achieve the principles and objectives of Secured by Design to improve community safety and crime prevention.\r",
    "Prior to occupation final details of any landscaping or treatment to the communal amenity space shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.  The approved measures shall be implemented on site prior to occupation and shall be retained thereafter.\r\rReason:  To ensure the amenity space is of a suitable standard in accordance with Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan.\r"
  ],
